 "phrases": [
  {
   "text": "A scientist talked people into falling off a fifteen-story tower,",
   "s": 0.0,
   "e": 3.111
  },
  {
   "text": "just to catch time cheating.",
   "s": 3.361,
   "e": 4.617
  },
  {
   "text": "You see, car crash survivors all swear the same thing:",
   "s": 5.027,
   "e": 7.451
  },
  {
   "text": "the world went into slow motion.",
   "s": 7.73,
   "e": 9.12
  },
  {
   "text": "So he strapped a tiny screen to every jumper's wrist.",
   "s": 9.516,
   "e": 11.97
  },
  {
   "text": "It flashed numbers just a little too fast to read.",
   "s": 12.263,
   "e": 14.47
  },
  {
   "text": "If a scared brain really slows time down,",
   "s": 14.9,
   "e": 16.922
  },
  {
   "text": "they should read them in mid-air.",
   "s": 17.151,
   "e": 18.313
  },
  {
   "text": "One by one, they dropped, screaming, straight into the net.",
   "s": 18.752,
   "e": 21.28
  },
  {
   "text": "Every jumper swore the fall took forever.",
   "s": 21.773,
   "e": 23.682
  },
  {
   "text": "Way longer than it really did.",
   "s": 24.004,
   "e": 25.206
  },
  {
   "text": "But not one of them could read a single number.",
   "s": 25.561,
   "e": 27.403
  },
  {
   "text": "Here's the trick.",
   "s": 27.883,
   "e": 28.466
  },
  {
   "text": "When you're terrified,",
   "s": 28.802,
   "e": 29.617
  },
  {
   "text": "your brain doesn't slow time down.",
   "s": 29.738,
   "e": 31.22
  },
  {
   "text": "It just takes way more notes.",
   "s": 31.535,
   "e": 32.844
  },
  {
   "text": "So when you look back,",
   "s": 33.185,
   "e": 34.038
  },
  {
   "text": "all those extra memories stretch three seconds into something that feels much longer.",
   "s": 34.266,
   "e": 38.148
  }
 ]
}